<title>USA: Fort Lauderdale, Fla., bonds won by Smith Barney.</title>
<headline>Fort Lauderdale, Fla., bonds won by Smith Barney.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smith Barney Inc. said Thursday it won $35 million Fort Lauderdale, Fla., unlimited tax bonds at a true interest cost of 5.43 percent.</p>
</text>
